# Runtime data / logs
data/
# anchored to repo root (leading slash) — the unanchored "logs/" matched ANY directory named
# "logs" anywhere in the tree, which silently caught dashboard/src/app/logs/ (a real Next.js
# route, not runtime log output) and kept its page.tsx untracked/unbacked-up since 7/17.
/logs/
